  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and juice oranges into a medium saucepan."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add salt and water to the saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat. Once boiling, stir in oats, cranberries, cinnamon, and maple syrup; reduce heat to medium-low. Cover and let simmer for 3-5 minutes or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop the pistachios."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oats between bowls and top with pistachios and milk. Enjoy!"
